# The shipped ticket prompts in packages/tickets-engine/prompts/ are
# byte-compared raw (default-prompts.spec.ts): LF, newline-terminated.
# GitHub's Windows runners default to core.autocrlf=true, which would check
# the LF blobs out as CRLF and fail CI while local worktrees (never
# re-checked out) stay green. eol=lf overrides autocrlf at checkout.
packages/tickets-engine/prompts/*.md text eol=lf

# Migration-tool fixtures are legacy ticket files compared byte for byte (E14-3): LF at checkout
packages/tickets-engine/src/migrate/fixtures/** text eol=lf
